1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,395
You step out

2
00:00:00,395 --> 00:00:01,620
of a dark cinema,

3
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:02,561
into the sun,

4
00:00:02,561 --> 00:00:03,130
and—

5
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:05,720
Bless you.

6
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:06,900
It's not a cold.

7
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:07,793
About one in four

8
00:00:07,793 --> 00:00:08,929
people sneeze

9
00:00:08,929 --> 00:00:10,950
at sudden bright light.

10
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:11,891
Why?

11
00:00:11,891 --> 00:00:13,010
Scientists think it's

12
00:00:13,010 --> 00:00:14,200
crossed wires.

13
00:00:14,226 --> 00:00:15,507
The nerve from your eyes

14
00:00:15,507 --> 00:00:16,189
runs close

15
00:00:16,189 --> 00:00:16,757
to the nerve

16
00:00:16,757 --> 00:00:18,326
that guards your nose.

17
00:00:18,326 --> 00:00:19,552
A sudden flood of light

18
00:00:19,552 --> 00:00:20,742
fires one...

19
00:00:20,742 --> 00:00:21,401
and spills

20
00:00:21,401 --> 00:00:22,267
into the other.

21
00:00:22,318 --> 00:00:23,970
So your brain hears:

22
00:00:23,970 --> 00:00:25,198
something's up the nose!

23
00:00:25,198 --> 00:00:26,000
FIRE!

24
00:00:26,763 --> 00:00:28,100
It runs in families.

25
00:00:28,138 --> 00:00:30,108
And its real medical name?

26
00:00:30,108 --> 00:00:32,920
"Ah-choo" syndrome.

27
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:33,778
Doctors did that

28
00:00:33,778 --> 00:00:35,033
on purpose.

29
00:00:35,085 --> 00:00:36,225
What helps?

30
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:37,950
Sunglasses.

31
00:00:38,015 --> 00:00:38,880
Next up:

32
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:39,530
why your foot

33
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:40,820
falls asleep.

34
00:00:40,850 --> 00:00:42,030
Subscribe!

35
00:00:42,445 --> 00:00:43,640
Bless you...

36
00:00:43,890 --> 00:00:44,920
again.

